Description:
 tbo        - Modern comic editor compatible with legacy TBO documents
Changes:
 tbo (2.0.0.dev0-1) unstable; urgency=medium
 .
   * Initial packaging of the Python/PyQt6 reimplementation.
   * Reads and writes the legacy .tbo format, interactive canvas, object
     editing, undo/redo, asset library, and PNG/PDF/SVG export.
   * Ships the doodle and speech bubble library under /usr/share/tbo/doodle.
